# Rentify Property Rental & Booking Platform - Frontend Environment Variables

# 1. Centralized Express Backend API URL (Do NOT hardcode backend URLs)
VITE_API_URL=https://your-express-backend.vercel.app/api

# 2. Stripe Public Key (Never expose Stripe secret keys in frontend environment variables)
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_51MockStripePublishableKeyForRentify2026

# SECURITY CHECKLIST:
# NEVER expose the following secrets in frontend code or environment variables:
# - MongoDB Connection URIs / Credentials
# - JWT Secret Keys
